2 CONC . 1–202. ISBN 0-521-06936-X.
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. E. (1993). "The Encyclopedia of Islam, VII". The Encyclopaedia of Islam, Vol. VII. Brill. pp. 1–1056. ISBN 90-04-09419-9.
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. E (1995). The Later Ghaznavids: Splendour and Decay: The Dynasty in Afghanistan and Northern India 1040-1186. Retrieved 17 May 2014.
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. Edmund (2001). "GHAZNAVIDS". Encyclopaedia Iranica, Vol. X, Fasc. 6. London et al. pp. 578–583.
2 CONT * Bosworth, C. Edmund (2013). "ḴOSROW MALEK". Encyclopaedia Iranica.
