2 CONT  Runciman 1989, p. 404.
2 CONT  Dédéyan & Rizk 2010, p. 96.
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT Runciman, Steven (1989). A History of the Crusades, Volume III: The Kingdom of Acre and the Later Crusades. Cambridge University Press. ISBN 0-521-06163-6.
2 CONT Dédéyan, Gérard; Rizk, Karam (2010). Le Comté de Tripoli: Etat Multiculturel Et Multiconfessionnel (1102-1289) (in French). Geuthner. ISBN 270533839X.
