2 CONC irlu Muhammad rebelled against his father, Amir Hasan Beg,  but on the approach of Amir Hasan Beg, he fled and took refuge with the Ottoman  Sultan Muhammad II 7 . In the following ye«r he was lured back by his father on the  pret
2 CONC ext of death, and was put to sword *.] ref https://archive.org/stream/HistoryOfShahIsmailSafawi-GhulamSarwar/119900259-History-of-Shah-Isma-il-Safawi-Ghulam-Sarwar_djvu.txt
2 CONT
2 CONT Uzun Hassan had several children. His firstborn son by a slave girl called Umm Valad wasOghurlu Mohammad, exiled to the Ottomans and finally executed by his father because of rebellion. (https://www.academia.edu/42221304/Origins_o
2 CONC f_the_Qajars_II_Are_we_Afrasiyab_s_heirs)
