2 GIVN Tahmasp I
2 _MARNM Safavi - r.1524-1576
2 NICK ‘Abu’l Muzaffar ‘Abu’l Fath Sultan Shah Tahmasb bin Shah Ismail al-Safavi al-Husayni al-Musavi
1 SEX M
