2 CONT Mesih had three known sons: [https://www.geni.com/people/Ali-Bey/6000000205091633822 Ali Bey], [https://www.geni.com/people/Mahmud-%C4%8Celebi/6000000205091146879 Mahmud Čelebi], and [https://www.geni.com/people/Bali-Bey/600000020
2 CONC 5091700823 Bali Bey], who served as sanjak bey of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanjak_of_Vi%C3%A7itrina Vulçitrin] in 1503.[8] 
