1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT HERE LYETH THE BODY OF THEODORO PALEOLOGVS / OF PESARO IN ITALY DESCENDEN FROM YE IMPERIAL / LYNE OF YE LAST CHRISTIAN EMPORERS OF GREECE / BEING THE SONNE OF CAMILO YE SONNE OF PROSPER / THE SONNE OF '''THEODORO''' THE SONNE OF '
2 CONC ''IOHN''' / Y SONNE OF THOMAS SECOND BROTHER TO COSTANTIN / PALEOLOGVS THE 8TH OF THAT NAME AND LAST OF / YE LYNE YT RAYGNED IN COSTANTINOPLE VNTILL SVB / DEWED BY THE TURKES WHO MARRIED WITH MARY / YE DAUGHTER OF WILLIAM BALLS OF
2 CONC  HADLYE IN / SOUFFOLKE GENT. & HAD ISSVE 5 CHILDREN THEO / DORO IOHN FERDINANDO MARIA & DOROTHY & DEPARTED THIS LIFE AT CLYTON YE 21YH OF IANVARY 1636.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT (Qui giace il corpo di [https://www.geni.com/people/Theodoros-Palaiologos/6000000000129362820 Teodoro Paleologi]  di Pesaro in Italia; discendente dalla linea imperiale degli ultimi imperatori cristiani della Grecia. È il figlio d
2 CONC i Camillo, figlio di Prosper, figlio di '''Teodoro''', figlio di [https://www.geni.com/people/Ioannis-Palaiologos/6000000000129362295 Giovanni], figlio di [https://www.geni.com/people/Tommaso-Paleologo-despota-di-Morea/60000000006
2 CONC 70173610 Tommaso] secondo fratello di [https://www.geni.com/people/Constantine-XI-Palaiologos-the-last-byzantine-emperor/6000000009965401953  Costantino Paleologi] 8° di questo nome e l'ultimo che ha regnato a Costantinopoli fino 
2 CONC alla conquista da parte dei turchi; ... )
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paleologi#cite_note-9
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT *https://www.theroyalforums.com/threads/the-byzantine-empire.4888/
2 CONT ** quoting  /!\ https://maltagenealogy.com/paleologo/ /!\ 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.1.2.1.1.1.2.7.2. Prince Manuel Paleologo, (1455-1516), married Princess Malkhatoun Zulkadr of Cappadocia, with issue.
2 CONT 1.1.2.1.1.1.2.7.2.1. Prince [https://www.geni.com/people/John-Palaiologos/6000000000512521332  John Paleologo]., married to Maria Phocas de Colneat, died in Turkey. 1558., with issue.
2 CONT 1.1.2.1.1.1.2.7.2.1.1. '''Prince Theodore Paleologo''', (1504-40)., with issue.
2 CONT 1.1.2.1.1.1.2.7.2.1.1.1. Prince Prospero Paleologo of Pesaro, with issue.
2 CONT 1.1.2.1.1.1.2.7.2.1.1.1.1. Prince Camillo Paleologo, with issue.
2 CONT 1.1.2.1.1.1.2.7.2.1.1.1.1.1. Prince Theodore Paleologo, (d. 1636) of Landulph Castle Cornwall, England, married to Mary Balls of Suffolk, with issue.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT /!\ -https://gw.geneanet.org/foullon?lang=en&pz=le+temps+et+la+relativite+les+eons+les+periodes...entite+ou+periode+reel+absolu+regissant+l+infiniment+petit+jusqu+a+l+infiniment+grand+compatible+quantiquement+avec+les+relativites&
2 CONC nz=de+l+espace&p=theodoros+palaiologos&n=paleologue
