2 CONT ## Lubkin, Gregory (1994). ''A Renaissance Court: Milan Under Galleazzo Maria Sforza.'' University of California Press.  Page 15.  < [https://books.google.com/books?id=NUoR2WFq_cUC&lpg=PA64&vq=%22bianca%20maria%22&pg=PA15#v=onepag
2 CONC e&q&f=false GoogleBooks] >
