2 CONC hus he was kin to Louis XI and Louis XII of France. He was a cardinal of the Roman Catholic Church for six months in 1533.[2] He was abbot in commendam of Bec, and concurrently archbishop of Toulouse (1503) and bishop of Orléans (
2 CONC 1521).
