2 CONT Ivan IV Vasilyevich (Russian:  Ива́н Четвёртый, Васи́льевич)​, Ivan Chetvyorty, Vasilyevich, known in English as Ivan the Terrible (Russian:  Ива́н Гро́зный​, Ivan Grozny). Tsar of All Russia: Reign 3. December 1533 – 28 March [O.
2 CONC S. 18 March] 1584 Coronation 16. January 1547.
2 CONT
