2 CONC She married Eustache de Erneville in 1362 at France.64,23,9 She and Eustache de Erneville had children.65
2 CONT
2 CONT Pierre de Neuville32 was also known as Pedro de Neufville.23 He was also known as Pedro de Neuville.9 He was born circa 1330 at France.32
