1 NAME Luiza /Grimaldi/
2 GIVN Luiza
2 _MARNM Grimaldi
2 NICK Luiza Grinalda
2 NICK Luísa Grimaldi -- 1st Lady proprietor of Espírito Santo ("Donatary") - 3rd in the timeline
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1541
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nice
3 STAE Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur
3 CTRY France
