2 CONT
2 CONT GURGIN KHAN - Shahnavaz Khan - Constantin - see page 129 of file:///home/chronos/u-3aee9e93dd168931eff71ff99c2a73e8c9317d8b/Downloads/1019-_Turkoloji_Tarix_Qarabaghname_Perviz_Zere_Shahmeresi_Fars_Ebced_Urmu_Turuz_2014.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Safavid governor of Qandahar until 1709 when he was overthrown by Mīrwais Khān Hotak - a Ghilzai Afghan notable -, Gurgin Khan was a Georgian convert to Islam, originally Giorgi XI and known in his converted state as Gurgin or Sha
2 CONC hnavaz Khan. He was a valued gholam in the Safavid service because of his military skills and sent to Qandahar in 1704 to secure Iran's bastion against Mughul India and prevent local unrest amongst the Afghans. [ref. pages 33 to 3
2 CONC 5 of The Cambridge History of Iran, volume 7].  
2 CONT
2 CONT Gurgin Khan will be murdered after Mīrwais Khān Hotak had a fatwa set against him in Mecca. Mir Vais succeeds him as Governor of Qandahar,. Mirwais Khan is anti Safavid.https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mirwais_Hotak
