1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Aslan II was the son of Salim I, Prince of Samtskhe. He was the grandson of Aslan I, Prince of Samtskhe and the nephew of Yusuf II of Samtskhe. He contended for the principality of Samtskhe with his cousin, Isaq I,
2 CONC  son of Yusuf II. He became ''pasha'', or prince, in 1705, only to be deposed in 1708. He was pasha again in 1716, only to lose to Isaq I in 1718. 
