2 CONT Prince Idar (Circassian: Айдар) was a Circassian ruler of the Caucasus. He was the son of Prince Inarmaz, and the grandson of Prince Tabula.[1] Prince Inarmaz himself was the eldest of the three grandsons of Prince Inal.[2] His ru
2 CONC le spanned over the period of 1525 to 1540.[3] 
