2 CONT Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise 1     Henri I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise was born in 1550. He was the son of François I de Lorraine, Duc de Guise and Anna d'Este. He married Catherine de Nevers, daughter of François de Cleves, Du
2 CONC c de Nevers and Margaret de Vendôme, in 1570. He died on 23 December 1588 at Chateau de Blois, France, murdered.2
