1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 32. BEATRIZ4 DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS (PEDRO3, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) died 1712 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico. She married DIEGO GARCIA-DE-QUINTANILLA September 20, 1676 in Sagrario Met
2 CONC ropolitano, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico, son of DIEGO GARCIA-DE-QUINTANILLA and MARIANA SALDIVAR-DE-SOSA. He was born 1657, and died 1699 in Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for BEATRIZ DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS:
2 CONT
2 CONT A.K.A. Beatriz de las Roelas del Valle.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for DIEGO GARCIA-DE-QUINTANILLA:
2 CONT
2 CONT In the book, Mil Familias III, by Rodolfo Gonzalez de la Garza, he is listed as a descendent of the Don Alonso of Estrada, Duke of Aragon. Page 37.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of BEATRIZ DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS and DIEGO GARCIA-DE-QUINTANILLA is:
2 CONT
