1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 35. MARIA3 GUAJARDO-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ (JUAN2 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, JUAN-FRANCISCO1) 
2 CONT *was born 1650, and 
2 CONT *died Aft. February 18, 1674/75 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico. 
2 CONT *She married CAPTAIN BARTOLOME DE LIZARRARRAS-Y-CUELLAR, 
2 CONT **son of ANTONIO DE LIZARRARRAS and ANA DE CUELLAR. He was born in Villa de Salamanca, Guanajuato, Mexico, and 
2 CONT **died March 20, 1704/05 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT ***Notes for MARIA GUAJARDO-FLORES-DE-VALDEZ: On Febuary 18,1675, she signed her last will and testament. Source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Page 117.
2 CONT ***Notes for CAPTAIN BARTOLOME DE LIZARRARRAS-Y-CUELLAR: On February 19, 1674, he signed his last will and testament. Source:Origen de los Fundadores de Texas, Nuevo Mexico, Coahulia, y Nuevo Leon, by Guillermo Garmendia Leal. Pag
2 CONC e 127.
2 CONT
