2 CONT He was also known as André de BETTENCOURT.762 He resided in Spain.763 He attained a grant for a blazon of arms, confirmed in Portugal, in 1505, in the person of his cousin Gaspar de Betencourt by D. Manuel (Arch. dos Açores, X, #5
2 CONC 2).764 He resided in Islas Canarias.765
