1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * from Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Fatma Sultan''' (Ottoman Turkish: فاطمہ سلطان) was an Ottoman princess, daughter of Selim II (reign 1566-74). She was the granddaughter of Suleiman the Magnificent (reign 1520-66) and Hürrem Sultan, sister of Sultan Murad III (
2 CONC reign 1574-95) and aunt of Sultan Mehmed III (reign 1595-1603).
2 CONT
2 CONT Fatma was married in 1572 to Damat Kanijeli Siyavuş Pasha (d. 1602), Governor of Rumelia and Grand Vizier 1582-1584, 1586-1589, and 1592-1593. She bore him four sons and one daughter.
