2 CONC cuments about Waqf preserved in the Oriental Department at the St. St. Cyril and Methodius National Library: Registers. Narodna biblioteka "Sv. sv. Kiril i Metodiĭ.
2 CONT * Peirce, Leslie P., The Imperial Harem: Women and Sovereignty in the Ottoman Empire, Oxford University Press, 1993, ISBN 0-19-508677-5 (paperback).
2 CONT * Yavuz Bahadıroğlu, Resimli Osmanlı Tarihi, Nesil Yayınları (Ottoman History with Illustrations, Nesil Publications), 15th Ed., 2009, ISBN 978-975-269-299-2 (Hardcover).
2 CONT
2 CONT =[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ismihan_Sultan#Issue Issue]==
2 CONT
2 CONT From her first marriage, Ismihan had a daughter and three sons:[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Safiye-Han%C4%B1msultan/6000000204949689940 Safiye Hanımsultan] (1562 - ?): Ismihan Sultan's eldest child. She was firstly married to her father's cousin Sokollu Mustafa Pasha, governor of Buda. Afte
2 CONC r his execution in 1578, she married the new governor of Buda, [https://www.geni.com/people/Silahdar-Cafer-Pasha-governor-of-Buda/6000000204951033850 Silahdar Cafer Pasha]. After his death in 1587, she gave birth to their twin son
2 CONC s, [https://www.geni.com/people/Mehmed-Bey-died-as-child/6000000204951202854 Mehmed Bey] and [https://www.geni.com/people/Cafer-Bey-died-as-child/6000000204951232880 Cafer Bey], who died as children. She married thirdly to [https:
2 CONC //www.geni.com/people/Sultanzade-Abd%C3%BClbaki-Bey/6000000028525578975 Sultanzade Abdülbaki Bey], son of her mother's cousin [https://www.geni.com/people/H%C3%BCma%C5%9Fah-Sultan/6000000042093112132 Hümaşah Sultan].
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultanzade-Ahmed-Bey-Sokollu/6000000204950901828 Sultanzade Ahmed Bey] (1563 - 1567). Died in infancy, probably of smallpox.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Ibrahim-beg-Sokolov/6000000016749949834 Sultanzade Sokolluzâde Ibrahim Han Paşah] (1565 - 1621). In 1924 an his descendant, Sokulluzade Abdülbâki Ihsân Bey, married another Ottoman princess, Rukiye S
2 CONC ultan, granddaughter of Sultan Mehmed V.
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultanzade-Piri-Mehmed-Bey-Sokollu/6000000204950406867 Sultanzade Piri Mehmed Bey] (1566 - 1567). Died in early infancy, probably of smallpox.
2 CONT
2 CONT From her second marriage, Ismihan had a son:[5]
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/people/Sultanzade-Mahmud-Bey/6000000204950542912 Sultanzade Mahmud Bey] (5 August 1585 - 24 September 1585): Ismihan died giving birth to him. He died 50 days after his mother.
