2 CONC eerage and Baronetage, 107th edition.
2 CONT *4.[S22] Sir Bernard Burke, C.B. LL.D., A Genealogical History of the Dormant, Abeyant, Forfeited, and Extinct Peerages of the British Empire, new edition (1883; reprint, Baltimore, Maryland: Genealogical Publishing Company, 1978)
2 CONC , page 577. Hereinafter cited as Burkes Extinct Peerage.
