1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Notes for HENRY DE LA VALLETTE NOGARET COUNT CANDALE:
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry, duke of Foix Candale (1591-1639)
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry (Henri) de Nogaret de La Valette (d.1639)was the eldest son of Jean Louis de Nogaret de La Valette (1554-1642), first Duke of Épernon and Admiral of France, and his wife Marguerite de Foix (1567-1593), comtesse de Candale. F
2 CONC rom his mother Henri inherited the title of Comte de Candale, becoming the 7th of that line.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henri made a career of the military, serving under Richelieu, in the armies of Guienne, of Picardy and of Italy. He was created duc de Candale in 1621, but that title became extinct upon his death and his brother Bernard succeeded
2 CONC  him as the 8th Comte de Candale.
