2 CONT 198. MAJOR DIEGO6 RAMON (CATARINA5 MARTINEZ-GUAJARDO, ISABEL4 GARCIA-DEL-VALLE, PEDRO3 DE-LOS-SANTOS-DE-ROJO-RUELAS, BERNARDO2 DE-LOS-SANTOS-COY, JUAN1 DE CALIZ) 
2 CONT *was born 1641 in Queretaro, Queretaro, Mexico, and 
