2 CONT *He married (3) FELICIANA CAMACHO-Y-BOTELLO Abt. 1676, 
2 CONT **daughter of ANDRES CAMACHO-Y-OLEA and JUANA BOTELLO-DE-MORALES. She was born Abt. 1660 in Saltillo, Coahuila, Mexico.
