2 CONT *****The Spanish Borderlands Frontier 1513-1821, by John Francis Bannon.
2 CONT *****The North Frontier of New Spain by Peter Gerhard.
2 CONT *****The Presidio and Militia on the Northern Frontier of New Spain, Volume Two, by Diana Hadley, Thomas H. Nayloy, and Mardith K. Schuetz-Miller.
2 CONT *****Remember Goliad, By Clarence Wharton.
2 CONT *****The Handbook of Texas Online.
