2 CONT Notes for DONA ANTONIA RAMON-CAMACHO:
2 CONT
2 CONT Her father, Major Diego Ramon, was the Commander of the Presidio de San Juan Bautista del Rio, at Coahulia, Mexico. It was during this period that the Major's step grand-daughter, Dona Maria Manuela Sanchez Navarro y Gomez Mascorr
2 CONC y married the french Cavalier, Louis Juchereau de Saint Denis, military commander of Natchitoches, Louisiana.
2 CONT
2 CONT Between March 1691 to June 1698, Major Diego Ramon served as the governor of Coahuila, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note:I have included this genealogy in the chapter titled, The Descendents of Major Diego Ramon and
2 CONT
2 CONT Dona Feliciana Camacho y Botello.
